Trial","view_more_tracks":"View more tracks","add_to_collection":"Add to collection","copy_to_clipboard":"Copy to clipboard","downloading_video":"Downloading video...","explore_all_music":"Explore All Music","free_stock_images":"Free Stock Images","full_screen_video":"Full Screen Video","nothing_to_select":"Nothing to select","open_premium_beat":"Open premium beat","ai_music_generator":"AI Music Generator","ai_video_generator":"AI Video Generator","ai_video_workflows":"AI Video Workflows","explore_all_images":"Explore All Images","explore_all_videos":"Explore All Videos","explore_categories":"Explore Categories","generate_voiceover":"Generate voiceover","open_ai_model_page":"Open AI Model Page","open_creators_page":"Open Creator’s page","open_download_menu":"Open download menu","stock_video_scenes":"Stock Video Scenes Footage","your_scenes_awaits":"Your Video Scenes Awaits","your_videos_awaits":"Your Videos Awaits","ai_images_generator":"AI Images Generator","artist_ai_workflows":"Artist AI workflows","change_aspect_ratio":"Change aspect ratio","coverr_plus_enabled":"Coverr Plus Enabled","explore_collections":"Explore Collections","high_fidelity_audio":"High-Fidelity Audio","open_affiliate_page":"Open affiliate’s page","open_category_param":"Open {{ name }} Category","open_workflow_param":"Open {{ name }} AI Workflow","primary_social_link":"Primary social link","stock_video_footage":"Stock Video Footage","upgrade_to_get_more":"Upgrade to get more","explore_coverr_music":"Explore Coverr music","explore_related_tags":"Explore related tags","upgrade_and_download":"Upgrade to Plus and download","generate_sound_effect":"Generate sound effect","open_collection_param":"Open {{ name }} Collection","free_commercial_rights":"Free Commercial Rights","open_ai_credit_history":"Open AI Credit History","ai_voice_over_generator":"AI Voice Over","open_contributor_social":"Open contributor’s social","your_scenes_description":"Your Video Scenes is ready to showcase your content. Add scenes here to organize your videos","your_videos_description":"Your Videos is ready to showcase your content. Add your videos here to create a personalized video that reflects your creativity","download_all_scene_files":"Download all scene videos","generate_similar_with_ai":"Generate similar with AI","generating_video_message":"We are generating your video. It may take up to a few minutes.","options_from_our_partner":"Options from our partner","ai_sound_effects_generator":"AI Sound Effects","start_for_free_and_download":"Start for Free and download","standard_quality_description":"MP3 file, compressed quality","high_fidelity_audio_description":"WAV format, ideal for professional projects"},"account":{"errors":{"email":{"regex":"Please enter a valid email address","unique":"Email is already taken","required":"Email is required"},"fullname":{"required":"Name is required"},"password":{"regex":"The password must contain a lowercase and uppercase letter, as well as at least one number","required":"Password is required","minlength":"Password must be at least 8 characters long"},"username":{"regex":"Please enter a valid username","unique":"Username is already taken","required":"Username is required","minlength":"Username must be at least 4 characters long"},"social_link":{"regex":"Please enter a valid url","required":"Url is required"},"update_user":"Error updating user","invalid_creds":"Email or password is not valid","request_email_verification":"Email is not verificated"}},"filters":{"ai":{"hide":"Hide AI-generated","show":"Show AI-generated"}},"license":{"faq":{"title":"FAQs","questions":[{"answer":"So glad you asked! No you’re not.\u003Cbr>\u003Cbr>Coverr videos can’t be resold or offered as part of services to which providing videos can help. This applies to stock video sites, website builders, themes providers, mobile apps builders and video editing services.","question":"Am I allowed to sell or redistribute the videos I download from Coverr?"},{"answer":"Well, that’s not really a question. But, that does make sense. Coverr started as CC0 (no copyright reserved), so many stock sites took our videos and sold or gave them away on their sites. We’ve since decided to keep our videos free to use for commercial purposes as long as it’s not by competitors. We put a lot of resources into bringing you these videos, so we’ve decided to offer them exclusively on our own site.","question":"I saw a video from Coverr on another stock video site."},{"answer":"Yes, we do! Please check more details \u003Ca href=\"/developers\" aria-label=\"Developers page\">here\u003C/a>.","question":"Do you have an API?"},{"answer":"Of course you can, please do!","question":"Can I use a Coverr video for a commercial I’m making?"},{"answer":"All of our videos are HD in MP4 format. We sometimes also offer 4K quality, which you’re able to download free as well.","question":"What’s the format and quality of your videos?"},{"answer":"For Zoom virtual backgrounds check out \u003Ca href=\"https://medium.com/coverr/rock-your-zoom-video-meetings-with-fun-video-backgrounds-6cc69789a890\" target=\"_blank\">our blog post\u003C/a>\u003Cbr>\u003Cbr>For implementing videos as homepage backgrounds, here are some resources our community finds helpful:\u003Cbr>\u003Cbr>\u003Ca href=\"https://webflow.com/blog/website-background-video-tips-tricks-and-resources\" target=\"_blank\">Webflow\u003C/a>, \u003Ca href=\"https://codepen.io/shshaw/pen/OVGWLG\" target=\"_blank\">CodePen\u003C/a>, \u003Ca href=\"https://stackoverflow.com/questions/10797632/simulate-background-sizecover-on-video-or-img\" target=\"_blank\">StackOverFlow\u003C/a>","question":"How do I implement a Coverr as a background video?"},{"answer":"Let’s talk! Check out our partners page \u003Ca href=\"/advertise\" title=\"Advertise page\">here\u003C/a>.","question":"Can we advertise on Coverr?"},{"answer":"Because Cover.com was taken.","question":"Why is Coverr spelled with two Rs?"},{"answer":"Check out our contributors page \u003Ca href=\"/contribute\" aria-label=\"Contribute page\">here\u003C/a>.","question":"How can I contribute a video?"},{"answer":"While we’re constantly hiring contributors to add new videos, we don’t always have the perfect video for every search query, so we supplement our catalog with Shutterstock’s collection. Plus, it helps us keep the lights on :)","question":"Why do I sometimes see Shutterstock videos on Coverr?"},{"answer":"Please do. Hit us up at \u003Ca href=\"mailto:team@coverr.co\" target=\"_blank\">team@coverr.co\u003C/a>. We’re fast repliers!","question":"I have an interesting idea for collaboration, can I reach out?"},{"answer":"If you insist. Bun is a border collie with endless energy and the world’s best head tilt. You can see more footage of him \u003Ca href=\"https://coverr.co/videos/dog-walking-and-red-flowers-Ntxfqdqff1\" target=\"_blank\">here\u003C/a> and \u003Ca href=\"https://coverr.co/videos/dog-taking-a-break-outdoors-C5qfQ2fp5V\" target=\"_blank\">here\u003C/a>. Lulu is a XX-year-old toy poodle who will leap into your lap and stay there all day. Watch her strut her stuff \u003Ca href=\"https://coverr.co/videos/puppy-exploring-nature-ZnxXAeMX3Y\" target=\"_blank\">here\u003C/a> and \u003Ca href=\"https://coverr.co/videos/poodle-out-the-car-window-meGkNEprcV\" target=\"_blank\">here\u003C/a>.","question":"Tell me more about your mascots!"},{"answer":"What can’t you do with it! Videos have been shown to increase engagement over photos, so consider a video the next time you want to add visual interest to a project. Think: b-roll footage to create seamless transitions, backgrounds for every environment (video conferencing, websites), footage for your next music video, promo ad, or social media post. The opportunities are endless.","question":"What can I do with stock footage?"}]},"meta":{"title":"Free Stock Video Footage License | Coverr","description":"All Videos published on Coverr.co can be used free for commercial and non-commercial purposes. You do not need to ask permission from or provide credit to the videographer or Coverr.co, although it is appreciated when possible."},"title":"License","section_1":{"li_1":"Use Content for Free: You may use Coverr.co’s videos and music for both commercial and non-commercial purposes at no cost.","title":"What You Can Do:","attribution_requirements":{"li_1":"Free Downloads: If you download Coverr.co’s content for free, you must add an attribution credit to the original creator or to Coverr.co.","li_2":"Coverr+ Members: If you’re a Coverr+ subscriber, you are not required to provide attribution (though it’s still appreciated).","title":"Attribution Requirements"}},"section_2":{"li_1":"Replicate Our Service: You may not use our content to build or offer a service that is similar to or competes with Coverr.co.","li_2":"Use for AI Training or Datasets: Our videos and music must not be used to train AI algorithms, develop AI models, or serve as part of any dataset for such purposes.","title":"What You Can’t Do:","assume":{"li_1":"While we do obtain model releases for individuals appearing in our content, we do not provide these releases to users.","li_2":"We do not hold releases for any brands, trademarks, or identifiable properties or landmarks that may appear in the content.","title":"Assume All Rights Are Cleared"}},"section_3":{"p_1":"All videos and music tracks published on Coverr.co are available for free for both commercial and non-commercial purposes. You are not required to seek permission from or provide credit to the content creator or Coverr.co, although it is appreciated when possible.","p_2":"Coverr.co grants you an irrevocable, non-exclusive, worldwide copyright license to download, copy, modify, perform, and use videos and music from Coverr.co for free, including for commercial purposes, without needing permission from the content creator or Coverr.co.","title":"Usage Rights:"},"section_4":{"li_1":"Compiling videos or music from Coverr.co to create a similar or competing service.","li_2":"Using videos or music from Coverr.co for training AI algorithms, creating AI models, or as a dataset in any form.","li_3":"Utilizing trademarks, logos, or brands that appear in the videos or music tracks. Separate permission from the respective brand owners may be required for your intended use.","title":"This license does not permit:"},"section_5":{"li_1":"Legal Rights in Content: Other legal rights should be considered when using videos and music, especially for commercial purposes. This includes rights of privacy, publicity, access rights, trademarks, and copyright for what’s depicted within the content.","li_2":"Commercial Use Considerations: Recognizable individuals have rights related to commercial use of their image and likeness. Private properties and restricted areas may require specific releases for commercial uses. Objects and trademarks in the content may be protected and require permission for use.","li_3":"Content Uploads: While Coverr.co requires content uploaded to our platform to have the necessary releases, especially for identifiable individuals, we cannot guarantee the scope of permitted uses for each piece of content. Users are responsible for ensuring their intended use complies with all applicable laws and does not infringe on third-party rights.","title":"Releases and Trademarks:"},"section_6":{"p_1":"It is the user’s responsibility to ensure that their use of Coverr.co’s videos and music complies with all applicable laws and regulations and does not infringe on the rights of any third party. Users should seek legal advice if uncertain about the legal implications of their intended use of a video or music track.","title":"User Responsibility:"},"section_7":{"p_1":"Coverr.co reserves the right to modify these license terms at any time. Continued use of the site and its content following any such changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.","title":"Changes to License Terms:"}},"privacy":{"li_1":{"li_1":"\u003Cstrong>Information You Provide.\u003C/strong> For registration purposes and some of the features of the Services we ask you to provide certain personal information, including name and email address.","li_2":"\u003Cstrong>Third Parties.\u003C/strong> We sometimes supplement the information that you provide with information that is received from third parties.","li_3":"\u003Cstrong>User Communications. \u003C/strong> When you send emails or other communication to Coverr, we may retain those communications and the details therein. If you subscribed on the Website to receive our newsletter, we will use your name and e-mail address to send you our newsletters and other promotional communications, you may opt-out of this service at any time by unsubscribing.","li_4":"\u003Cstrong>User Information. \u003C/strong> When you use the Website, we may automatically receive and record information from your browser, including without limitation information and statistics about your online/offline status, your IP address, internet service provider, search history, type of browser, your regional and language settings and software and hardware attributes. Our systems may automatically record and store technical information regarding the method and nature of your use of the Website. An IP address is a numeric code that identifies your browser on a network, or in this case, the Internet. Your IP address is also used to gather broad demographic information. Coverr uses such PII in order to understand the usage trends of our Website and improve it.","description":"\u003Cstrong>Information We Collect and How We Use It.\u003C/strong> In order to provide and improve our Website, we may collect and process PII, including the following types of information: "},"li_2":"\u003Cstrong>Cookies.\u003C/strong> In order to collect the data described herein we may use temporary cookies that remain on your browser for a limited period of time. We may also use persistent cookies that remain on your browser until it is closed, in order to manage and maintain the Website and record your use of the Website. Cookies by themselves cannot be used to discover the identity of the user. A cookie is a small piece of information which is sent to and stored on your browser. Cookies do not damage your browser. Most browsers may allow you to block cookies but you may not be able to use some features on the Website if you block them. You may set most browsers to notify you if you receive a cookie (this enables you to decide if you want to accept it or not). We may also use web beacons via the Website to collect information. Web beacons or \"gifs\", are electronic images that may be used in our Website or in our emails. We use Web beacons to deliver cookies, count visits and to tell if an email has been opened and acted upon.","li_3":"\u003Cstrong>Links.\u003C/strong> Links to other services, sites and applications may be provided by Coverr as a convenience to our users. Coverr is not responsible for the privacy practices or the content of other sites and applications and you visit them at your own risk. This Privacy Policy applies solely to PII collected by us. ","li_4":"\u003Cstrong>Children.\u003C/strong> If you are a child under the age of 18, you must obtain parental consent prior to using our Website. Coverr will not knowingly contact or engage with children under the age of 18 without said parental consent. If you have reason to believe that a child has provided us with their PII, please contact us at the address given above and we will endeavor to delete that PII from our databases. ","li_5":"\u003Cstrong>Information Sharing.\u003C/strong> As part of providing the Website our affiliates, agents and representatives may have access to your PII. We require these parties to process such information in compliance with this Privacy Policy and subject to security and other appropriate confidentiality safeguards.  Coverr may also share PII in the following circumstances: (a) as required for the provision, maintenance and improvement of the Website; (b) if we become involved in a reorganization, merger, consolidation, acquisition, or any form of sale of some or all of our assets, with any type of entity, whether public, private, foreign or local; and/or (c) to satisfy applicable law or prevention of fraud or harm or to enforce applicable agreements and/or their terms, including investigation of potential violations thereof. ","li_6":"\u003Cstrong>Information Security.\u003C/strong> We follow generally accepted industry standards to protect against unauthorized access to or unauthorized alteration, disclosure or destruction of PII. However, no method of transmission over the Internet, or method of electronic storage, is 100% secure. Therefore, while we strive to use commercially acceptable means to protect your PII, we cannot guarantee its absolute security. We retain your PII only for as long as reasonably necessary for the purposes for which it was collected or to comply with any applicable legal or ethical reporting or document retention requirements.","li_7":"\u003Cstrong>Data Integrity.\u003C/strong> Coverr processes PII only for the purposes for which it was collected and in accordance with this Privacy Policy or any applicable service agreements. We review our data collection, storage and processing practices to ensure that we only collect, store and process the PII needed to provide or improve our Website. We take reasonable steps to ensure that the PII we process is accurate, complete, and current, but we depend on our users to update or correct their PII whenever necessary. Nothing in this Privacy Policy is interpreted as an obligation to store information, and we may, at our own discretion, delete or avoid from recording and storing any and all information.","li_8":{"li_1":"\u003Cstrong>Right of Access and Rectification.\u003C/strong> You have the right to know what PII we collect about you and to ensure that such data is accurate and relevant for the purposes for which we collected it. We allow our users the option to access and obtain a copy of their PII and to rectify such PII if it is not accurate, complete or updated. However we may first ask you to provide us certain credentials to permit us to identify your PII. ","li_2":"\u003Cstrong>Right to Delete PII or Restrict Processing. \u003C/strong>  You have the right to delete your PII or restrict its processing. We may postpone or deny your request if your PII is in current use for the purposes for which it was collected or for other legitimate purposes such as compliance with legal obligations.  ","li_3":"\u003Cstrong>Right to Withdraw Consent.\u003C/strong> You have the right to withdraw your consent to the processing of your PII. Exercising this right will not affect the lawfulness of processing your PII based on your consent before its withdrawal.","li_4":"\u003Cstrong>Right of Data Portability.\u003C/strong> Where technically feasible, you have the right to ask to transfer your PII in accordance with your right to data portability. ","li_5":"You may exercise the above rights by sending a request to \u003Ca href=\"mailto: team@coverr.co\" target=\"_blank\">\u003Ci>team@coverr.co\u003C/i>\u003C/a>.","li_6":"\u003Cstrong>Right to Lodge Complaint.\u003C/strong> You also have the right to lodge a complaint with a data protection supervisory authority regarding the processing of your PII.  ","description":"\u003Cstrong>Your Rights. \u003C/strong>"},"li_9":"\u003Cstrong>Enforcement. \u003C/strong> Coverr regularly reviews its compliance with this Privacy Policy. Please feel free to direct any questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy or our treatment of PII by contacting us as provided above. When we receive formal written complaints it is Coverr’s policy to contact the complaining user regarding his or her concerns. We will cooperate with the appropriate regulatory authorities, including local data protection authorities, to resolve any complaints regarding the transfer of PII that cannot be resolved between Coverr and an individual.","meta":{"title":"Free Stock Video Footage Privacy Policy | Coverr","description":"All Videos published on Coverr.co can be used free for commercial and non-commercial purposes. You do not need to ask permission from or provide credit to the videographer or Coverr.co, although it is appreciated when possible."},"li_10":"\u003Cstrong>Changes to This Privacy Policy.\u003C/strong> Coverr may update this Privacy Policy. We will notify you about significant changes in the way we treat PII by placing a prominent notice on the Website. We encourage you to periodically review this Privacy Policy for the latest information about our privacy practices.","li_11":"\u003Cstrong>Consent To Processing.\u003C/strong> By providing any PII to us pursuant to this Privacy Policy, all users, including, without limitation, users in the United States, Israel and member states of the European Union, fully understand and unambiguously consent to this Privacy Policy and to the collection and processing of such PII abroad. The server on which the Website is hosted and/or through which the Website is processed may be outside the country from which you access the Website and may be outside your country of residence. Some of the uses and disclosures mentioned in this Privacy Policy may involve the transfer of your PII to various countries around the world that may have different levels of privacy protection than your country. By submitting your PII through the Website, you consent, acknowledge, and agree that we may collect, use, transfer, and disclose your PII as described in this Privacy Policy. You hereby acknowledge that your consent is provided at your volition and not due to a legal obligation.","li_12":"\u003Cstrong>Questions.\u003C/strong> If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy or concerns about the way we process your PII, please contact us at  \u003Ca href=\"mailto: team@coverr.co\" target=\"_blank\">\u003Ci>team@coverr.co\u003C/i>\u003C/a>.","li_13":"If you want your account deleted please email us at \u003Ca href=\"mailto: team@coverr.co\" target=\"_blank\">\u003Ci>team@coverr.co\u003C/i>\u003C/a>.","title":"COVERR PRIVACY POLICY (\"PRIVACY POLICY\") ","section_1":"IMPORTANT: BY VISITING VEEDME LTD.’S (\u003Cstrong>\"COVERR\"\u003C/strong> OR (\u003Cstrong>\"WE\"\u003C/strong>) WEBSITE AT \u003Ca href=\"https://coverr.co/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://coverr.co/\u003C/a> (\u003Cstrong>“WEBSITE”\u003C/strong>) YOU (\u003Cstrong>\"YOU\"\u003C/strong>) CONSENT TO THE TERMS AND CONDITIONS OF THIS PRIVACY POLICY AND CONSENT THAT ALL PERSONALLY IDENTIFIABLE INFORMATION (\u003Cstrong>\"PII\"\u003C/strong>) THAT YOU SUBMIT OR THAT IS PROCESSED OR COLLECTED THROUGH THE WEBSITE MAY BE PROCESSED BY COVERR AND ITS AFFILIATES IN THE MANNER AND FOR THE PURPOSES DESCRIBED IN THE FOLLOWING PRIVACY POLICY.","section_2":"WE DEFINE “PII” TO MEAN ANY INFORMATION RELATING TO AN IDENTIFIED OR IDENTIFIABLE NATURAL PERSON; AN IDENTIFIABLE NATURAL PERSON IS ONE WHO CAN BE IDENTIFIED, DIRECTLY OR INDIRECTLY, IN PARTICULAR BY REFERENCE TO AN IDENTIFIER SUCH AS A NAME, AN IDENTIFICATION NUMBER, LOCATION DATA, AN ONLINE IDENTIFIER OR TO ONE OR MORE FACTORS SPECIFIC TO THE PHYSICAL, PHYSIOLOGICAL, GENETIC, MENTAL, ECONOMIC, CULTURAL OR SOCIAL IDENTITY OF THAT NATURAL PERSON.","section_3":"IF YOU DO NOT AGREE TO THE TERMS AND CONDITIONS SET FORTH HEREIN PLEASE DO NOT USE THE WEBSITE.","section_4":"We recognize that privacy is important. This Privacy Policy applies to all of the services, information, tools, features and functionality available on the Website offered by Coverr or its subsidiaries or affiliated companies and covers how PII that Coverr collects and receives, including in respect of any use of the Website, is treated. If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please feel free to contact us at: \u003Ca href=\"mailto: team@coverr.co\" target=\"_blank\">\u003Ci>team@coverr.co\u003C/i>\u003C/a>.","section_5":"Please also read the Coverr’s Term of Use at: \u003Ca href=\"https://coverr.co/terms/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://coverr.co/terms/\u003C/a>, which describe the terms under which you use our Website.","section_6":"\u003Ci>Last Date Updated: April 14, 2019.\u003C/i>"},"profile":{"api":{"title":"API Keys"},"deals":{"meta":{"title":"Your Deals | Coverr","description":"Your active deals and pricing overrides"},"empty":"No deals available.","title":"Your Deals","types":{"text":"Text Generation","audio":"Audio Generation","image":"Image Generation","video":"Video Generation"},"status":{"active":"Active","expired":"Expired","inactive":"Inactive"},"columns":{"deal":"Deal","type":"Type","status":"Status","actions":"Actions","deal_name":"Feature"},"upgrade":"Upgrade","unlimited_for_months":"Unlimited for {{ count }} months","credits_per_generation":"{{ count }} credits / generation"},"images":{"meta":{"title":"My Images | Coverr","description":"My Images"},"title":"My Images","copy_url":"Copy URL","upload_images":"Upload Images"},"scenes":{"form":{"title":"Edit Scene Name"},"meta":{"title":"My video scenes | Coverr","description":"My video scenes"}},"videos":{"form":{"title":"Edit Video"},"meta":{"title":"My videos | Coverr","description":"My videos"}},"security":{"meta":{"title":"Security | Coverr","description":"Change password"}},"settings":"Settings","downloads":"Downloads","user_menu":{"api_keys":"API Keys","subscription":"Subscription"},"workflows":{"publish":"Publish","add_details":"Add details","open_workflow":"Open Workflow"},"edit_profile":"Edit profile","subscription":{"meta":{"title":"Subscription | Coverr","description":"Subscription details"},"cancel":"Cancel","change":"Change","yearly":"Yearly","billing":"Billing","expires":"Expires","monthly":"Monthly","per_month":"/mo","learn_more":"Learn more about Coverr+","upgrade_now":"Upgrade Now","payment_method":"Payment method",