Have a question or feedback? We’d love to hear from you"},"contribute":{"meta":{"title":"Contribute Free Stock Footage And Get Paid | Coverr","description":"The only free stock footage website that pays to its contributors | Coverr"},"title":"Contribute free videos/music, get paid.","apply_now":"Apply now","section_1":{"title":"We support our community","description":"While we give all our videos away for free, we believe in paying the talented creators behind them. Coverr videos are carefully curated and creators are paid for their submissions. The more we grow, the more contributors we’re able to support."},"section_2":{"title":"We have a wide reach","description":"Coverr videos are seen and shared by hundreds of thousands of users. You can see your work cropping up everywhere from inspirational music videos to the next best app."},"section_3":{"title":"We believe in accessibility","description":"We started Coverr as a way to give access to those who can’t afford to commission or buy video footage. You’ll be empowering countless startups, dreamers, and believers on their missions to make something."},"description":"Share your talent with the Coverr community, get paid for your work, and watch millions of users showcase your videos across the globe.","apply_section":{"apply":"Apply to Contribute","title":"Did we mention you’ll get paid?","description":"Just want to make sure you saw that."},"sections_title":"Why contribute to Coverr?"},"intentions":[{"label":"To create organic online content","value":"To create organic online content"},{"label":"For commercial projects (online or TV ads.)","value":"For commercial projects (online or TV ads.)"},{"label":"For educational purposes","value":"For educational purposes"},{"label":"As a background video for my site","value":"As a background video for my site"},{"label":"Use it in my design as a placeholder","value":"Use it in my design as a placeholder"},{"label":"Education - I’m a teacher","value":"Education - I’m a teach