CC","videoPreviewUrl":"https://cdn-staging.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-8BtVM6vgXw1F/1080p.mp4"},{"id":"4kxJ4R0qU6Bl","createdAt":"2025-10-28T15:25:33.941Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-28T15:25:33.941Z","name":"Neon metropolis","prompt":"Turn the environment into a futuristic neon city at night — glowing holographic signs, wet reflective streets, distant traffic lights, and fog illuminated by bright color gradients. Inspired by “Blade Runner”, the tone should be cinematic, cyberpunk, and moody, with realistic reflections and atmospheric depth.","appId":"dLXnNeCbJs1a","order":2,"key":"neon-metropolis","imagePreviewUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/-rnrDPU","videoPreviewUrl":"https://cdn-staging.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-IPI3L5wr0vHo/1080p.mp4"},{"id":"MyzKFiLqWOnH","createdAt":"2025-10-28T15:25:33.941Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-28T15:25:33.941Z","name":"Tropical shores","prompt":"Transform the setting into a sunlit tropical beach — turquoise ocean waves, palm trees swaying in the breeze, warm golden light, and a sense of calm paradise. Inspired by “The Beach”, the composition should radiate natural beauty and cinematic serenity, keeping the subject in harmony with the landscape.","appId":"dLXnNeCbJs1a","order":3,"key":"tropical-shores","imagePreviewUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/-OPIho0","videoPreviewUrl":"https://cdn-staging.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-O7xGnsn5VIBV/1080p.mp4"},{"id":"bSYC0Njn35mG","createdAt":"2025-10-28T15:25:33.941Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-28T15:25:33.941Z","name":"Frozen highlands","prompt":"Convert the environment into a high-altitude snowy wilderness — frosted terrain, distant mountain peaks, and icy wind drifting through the air. The light should be cool and crisp, with long shadows and realistic snow textures. Inspired by “The Revenant”, evoking isolation, purity, and raw cinematic power.","appId":"dLXnNeCbJs1a","order":4,"key":"frozen-highlands","imagePreviewUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/-3QVlyX","videoPreviewUrl":"http