ages/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-vqosxm03ag7o-out0lhauzy7x-E7xGmq","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=seedance-2-0-mini","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"2b9s1fOfVX","createdAt":"2026-06-25T13:06:50.206Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-25T13:06:50.206Z","title":"Seedance 2.0 Now Supports 4K","description":"Seedance 2.0 now generates native 4K video on Coverr — no upscaling. Sharper detail, cleaner textures, ready for brand videos and polished social content.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-0i88o9it8cbz-vnjpigszvh7a-XVAOEJ","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=seedance-2-0&resolution=4k","ctaCopy":"Try in 4K","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"rQ0XuetDop","createdAt":"2026-06-22T15:21:38.096Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-22T15:21:38.096Z","title":"Happy Horse 1.1 Is Now on Coverr — Sharper Motion, Better Lip-Sync","description":"We've upgraded Happy Horse to version 1.1 on Coverr's AI Video Generator. The update focuses on five targeted improvements: smoother, more physically grounded motion in fast-moving scenes — explosions, particle effects, dramatic weather — plus better handling of shot-reverse-shot and tracking shots for more natural multi-shot transitions.\n\nAudio gets an upgrade too: more natural dialogue pacing, richer ambient sound, and tighter lip-sync with less drift. Character and product consistency across multi-reference shots is also stronger, so brand details and identities hold up better across cuts.\n\nSame model you know, noticeably more refined output.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-d7n7eprvveyg-bycpyryn5h8h-IZ487j","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=happy-horse-1.1","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"48UmojeyqG","createdAt":"2026-06-22T15:21:29.846Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-22T15:21:29.846Z","title":"Kling 3.0 Turbo & Turbo Pro Are Now on Coverr","description":"We've added Kling 3.0 Turbo and Kling 3.0 Turbo Pro to Coverr's AI Video Generator — speed-tuned tier of the Kling 3.0 family.\n\nBoth models keep the strengths that make Kling 3.0 useful: strong prompt adherence, multi-shot scenes that hold character and setting consistent across cuts, and native audio with noticeably improved lip sync. They just get you there faster — built for batches of clips, quick variations, and testing ideas before committing to a final.\n\nTurbo Pro adds stronger consistency for image-to-video work, making it the better pick when a product's exact look needs to hold steady frame to frame.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-izixc2e1vd6j-arasdcffmekn-2qGYH2","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=kling-3-0-turbo","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"iVBv5TClCD","createdAt":"2026-06-22T13:33:37.694Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-25T13:03:51.603Z","title":"Lyria 3 and Lyria 3 Pro Are Now on Coverr — The Ultimate AI Music Models","description":"We've added Lyria 3 and Lyria 3 Pro to Coverr's AI Audio Generator — the latest music generation models from Google DeepMind.\n\nThe workflow is seamless: generate cinematic soundtracks, adaptive background ambiance, or full vocal tracks — tailored to your visuals in just one click. Lyria 3 is built for short instrumental clips (up to ~30 seconds), perfect for quick stings, loops, and background beds. Lyria 3 Pro generates full-length compositions (up to 3 minutes) with vocals, richer arrangements, and orchestral-level detail — ideal when your scene needs depth and emotional range.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/nuzo21efvuka-images-bmh4bnmk3yji-yfkkea0pexqb-LJxnsv","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-audio-generator?model=google-lyria-3-pro","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"d03zIbUK2X","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:48:04.130Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-11T11:48:04.130Z","title":"Grok 1.5 Is Now on Coverr — xAI's #1 Image-to-Video Model","description":"We've added Grok 1.5 to Coverr's AI Video Generator — xAI's latest model that currently sits at #1 on the Image-to-Video Arena leaderboard, outranking Seedance 2.0 and HappyHorse 1.0 in blind user testing.\n\nThe workflow is straightforward: upload a still image, describe the motion, camera move, and sound design — and the model animates the scene. Audio is generated in the same pass, no separate step needed. Synchronized dialogue, sound effects, and ambient audio are all baked in from the start.\n\nBuilt on xAI's Aurora autoregressive architecture, 1.5 keeps the lighting, details, and identity of your source image intact while bringing the scene to life.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-ghc1snensmxi-5xdzwcoivtg8-A4xqh6","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=grok-imagine-video-1.5","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"N6AfS1dmNi","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:47:54.224Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-11T11:47:54.224Z","title":"Wan 2.7 Is Now on Coverr — Alibaba's Most Controllable AI Video Model","description":"We've added Wan 2.7 to Coverr's AI Video Generator — the latest model from Alibaba's Tongyi Lab, built for creators who want more than just a prompt box.\n\nWan 2.7 gives you first and last frame control, multi-reference consistency and native audio sync. If you work from storyboards, build multi-shot sequences, or need a character to look the same across cuts — this is the model designed for that.\n\n27B parameters, 1080p output, up to 15 seconds. Text-to-video and image-to-video both supported.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-sczicysjaekb-k7bwx6xk4znk-ZPepd8","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=wan-2.7","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"2pel64J0tP","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:47:45.062Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-11T11:47:45.062Z","title":"LTX 2.3 Quality Is Now Available","description":"We've added the Quality tier of LTX 2.3 to Coverr's AI Video Generator — Lightricks' latest open-source model, now at its highest output setting.\n\nLTX 2.3 runs on a rebuilt 22B parameter architecture with a fully redesigned VAE that delivers sharper textures, cleaner faces, and better fine detail across the frame. The Quality tier gives you the full resolution and motion fidelity the model can produce — ideal when you need the final output to actually look finished.\n\nText-to-video and image-to-video both supported. Generate up to 20 seconds.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-bcpvxbaewtlu-ys529as9uqfp-7qCZKY","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=ltx-2.3-quality","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"6teuZr2q1r","createdAt":"2026-06-11T11:47:32.943Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-11T11:47:32.943Z","title":"Seedream 5 Lite Now Generates in 4K","description":"Seedream 5 Lite — ByteDance's image model with built-in reasoning and real-time web search — now supports 4K output on Coverr.\n\nThe upgrade means sharper details, cleaner edges, and images that hold up at any display size. Whether you're generating product visuals, campaign assets, or concept art, you're now working at full production resolution from the start.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-5ks0cylrvzja-un04t5ipwbhe-EoC4ud","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-images-generator?model=bytedance-seedream-5.0-lite&aspectRatio=auto_4K","ctaCopy":"Try in 4K","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"oyQW6fOHDx","createdAt":"2026-06-05T18:30:37.704Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-05T18:30:37.704Z","title":"Introducing Projects — Organize Your Generations","description":"You can now create Projects in Coverr's AI Studio. Group your generations by idea, campaign, or client — and keep everything in one place instead of scrolling through a single feed.\n\nStart a project, generate inside it, and come back to it whenever you're ready. Your creative work, organized the way you think about it.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-tudr85bbkoqw-ge2zki55z7t3-n76KBU","ctaUrl":"/studio/new?ctx=news","ctaCopy":"Create a Project","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"gfCveaGWTQ","createdAt":"2026-06-05T18:30:29.937Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-05T18:30:29.937Z","title":"Happy Horse 1.0 Is Now on Coverr","description":"Meet Happy Horse 1.0 — the open-source video model from Alibaba that quietly debuted on global benchmarks with no name attached, and shot straight to #1 in both text-to-video and image-to-video on the Artificial Analysis Arena leaderboard.\n\nWhat makes it different: video and audio are generated together in a single pass — not layered on after the fact. Dialogue, ambient sound, and Foley effects are baked in from the start, naturally synced to what's happening on screen.\n\n1080p output, fast generation, and a unified transformer architecture that sees every modality at once. Now live in Coverr's AI Studio.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-chpmak3xllqj-yep9swtetg4t-aCOziU","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=happy-horse&ctx=news","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"IY7JkoODzh","createdAt":"2026-06-05T18:30:22.302Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-05T18:30:22.302Z","title":"Kling Models Now 50% Cheaper","description":"We've cut the credit cost for Kling o3, Kling o3 Pro, Kling 3.0, and Kling 3.0 Pro by 50% — across the board.\n\nSame models, same quality, same output. Just half the price. If you've been rationing generations or saving Kling for final cuts only, now's the time to use it freely.\n\nGenerate more. Iterate faster. Keep the quality.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-k5vfg9ci7vim-flv2vonfjd25-M6pDIl","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=kling-3-0-pro&ctx=news","ctaCopy":"Start Generating","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"XQHLAheLZD","createdAt":"2026-06-05T18:30:12.368Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-05T18:30:12.368Z","title":"Kling 3.0 & Kling o3 Now Generate in 4K","description":"Both Kling 3.0 and Kling o3 now support native 4K output on Coverr — and native means native. No upscaling, no post-processing. The model generates at full 3840×2160 from the start, so every frame carries real spatial detail: sharp textures, clean edges, complex backgrounds that hold up at any screen size.\n\nIf you're producing content that needs to look polished — brand videos, cinematic shorts, social reels — this is the resolution where AI video stops looking like AI video.\n\nChoose Kling 3.0 4K or Kling o3  4K among the models and generate.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-gnrpithwtczb-9ghpbpys4xgu-9r7bK3","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=kling-o3-4k&ctx=news","ctaCopy":"Try in 4K","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"p6S8G4gJbN","createdAt":"2026-06-05T18:30:00.581Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-05T18:30:00.581Z","title":"Veo 3.1 Lite — Google's Most Accessible AI Video Model","description":"We've added Google's Veo 3.1 Lite to Coverr's AI Video Generator — the most affordable model in the Veo 3.1 family, built for creators who want Google-quality video without the premium price tag.\n\nVeo 3.1 Lite runs at the same speed as Veo 3.1 Fast and brings the same native audio generation — synchronized dialogue, sound effects, and ambient sound built right into every clip. Text-to-video and image-to-video both supported, with flexible output up to 1080p in landscape or portrait.\n\nIf you've been holding off on Veo because of credits — this is your entry point.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-5xamlkz1iqt5-7k4f84yz19xl-nIOKh0","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=google-veo-3-1-lite&ctx=news","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"aNLdeUoEZK","createdAt":"2026-06-05T18:29:50.144Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-05T18:29:50.144Z","title":"Seedance 2.0 Is Here — Multimodal Video Generation","description":"We've added Seedance 2.0 and Seedance 2.0 Fast to Coverr's AI Video Generator — both powered by ByteDance's latest multimodal architecture.\n\nSeedance 2.0 takes your ideas further by accepting text, images, video clips, and audio as inputs all at once. The result: cinematic-quality clips with strong character consistency, director-level camera control, and native audio sync out of the box.\n\nNeed results fast? Seedance 2.0 Fast delivers the same model quality with significantly quicker generation times — ideal when you're iterating quickly or working through a batch of ideas.\n\nBoth models are live now in the AI Studio. Pick your inputs, set your style, and generate.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/ysvsj1tnr7nw-images-6uafd6cqijjl-b3qkylieixkv-jgyYOE","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=seedance-2-0&ctx=news","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"wh6P0wnQXV","createdAt":"2025-08-26T14:56:58.521Z","updatedAt":"2025-08-26T14:56:58.521Z","title":"🎵 New: ElevenLabs AI Music","description":"Generate high-quality tracks up to 5 minutes long with our new AI Music Generator powered by ElevenLabs. Perfect for videos, podcasts, and creative projects.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/music-model-WvqhjO","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-audio-generator/generations?model=elevenlabs-music","ctaCopy":"Try it now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"eoPMTDJAVb","createdAt":"2025-07-24T19:43:06.263Z","updatedAt":"2025-08-26T14:53:42.512Z","title":"Introducing LTXV — Smarter, Sharper AI Video Generation","description":"We’ve added Lightricks LTXV to Coverr’s AI video generator — giving you a fresh way to create sharper, more refined video content with just a prompt. Whether you’re working on short-form social videos, creative storytelling, or visual experiments, LTXV brings improved motion quality, richer detail, and a more cinematic feel. You can now generate videos up to 60 seconds long — smooth, coherent, and ready to use. Try it out in the AI Studio and see what LTXV can bring to your next video.","imageUrl":"https://cdn-staging.coverr.co/user-content/Bj3bTlHX5W1g/images/jL5UvsnCJ1oS/sample_2.jpg","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator?model=lightricks-ltxv","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"ShPhpBLHNA","createdAt":"2025-07-24T18:53:05.722Z","updatedAt":"2025-08-26T14:53:48.524Z","title":"New AI Image Models Are Live — From Hyper-Real to Creatively Abstract","description":"We’ve just added three powerful AI models to Coverr’s image generator — each bringing its own unique creative edge.\nGoogle Imagen 4 Ultra: perfect for generating ultra-realistic, detailed images with incredible consistency and clarity. Great for product mockups, photorealistic scenes, and professional-looking visuals.\nFlux Kontext Pro & Kontext Max: designed for creators who want more expressive, stylized results. These models push artistic boundaries — whether you're going for cinematic lighting, surreal compositions, or rich visual storytelling. \nWith these additions, you now have even more freedom to explore different looks, moods, and creative directions — right inside Coverr’s AI Studio.","imageUrl":"https://cdn-staging.coverr.co/user-content/Bj3bTlHX5W1g/images/x75TyeYBvdGN/sample_0.jpg","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-images-generator/generations?model=flux-kontext-max","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"I1J97s0zmf","createdAt":"2025-07-24T18:00:50.974Z","updatedAt":"2025-08-26T14:53:57.247Z","title":"Lyria 2 Is Here — Create Music with More Depth","description":"We’ve added the latest Lyria 2 model to power AI music generation on Coverr — helping you create more dynamic, expressive soundtracks for your videos and projects. With improved sound quality and a wider range of styles, you’ll get more flexibility and better results from your prompts. Whether you're going for cinematic, ambient, or something in between, Lyria 2 gives you more creative room to shape your sound.\n\nExplore what’s new and start generating with Lyria 2 today.","imageUrl":"https://cdn-staging.coverr.co/user-content/Bj3bTlHX5W1g/images/rncqw7JjV4VC/sample_1.jpg","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-audio-generator/generations?model=google-lyria","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false},{"id":"iWlK83pyAr","createdAt":"2025-07-09T19:35:10.094Z","updatedAt":"2025-08-26T14:54:04.076Z","title":"New Models Arrived: Imagen 4 & Veo 3 Fast","description":"Meet the next evolution of AI creativity — Imagen 4 and Veo 3 Fast — now on our platform! Imagen 4 lets you generate ultra-sharp images with lifelike detail, from cinematic portraits to complex visual concepts. It handles lighting, depth, and even embedded text like a pro, giving your ideas clarity and polish in seconds. Meanwhile, Veo 3 Fast makes cinematic-quality video generation blazing fast. Whether you're crafting product trailers, stylized loops, or social-ready stories, it delivers smooth motion, expressive cuts, and visual consistency — instantly. Use both tools to move from static visuals to full-motion content without slowing your creative process.","imageUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/user-content/DR5b7hzNikOw/images/ioK8m6ZdzzjF/sample_0.jpg","ctaUrl":"/studio/ai-video-generator/generations?model=google-veo-3-fast","ctaCopy":"Try It Now!","status":"published","isPublished":true,"type":"newsfeed","votesCount":0,"hasVoted":false}],"total":26,"page":0,"pageSize":20,"pages":2,"nbHits":26,"nbPages":2,"hitsPerPage":20},"translations-en":{"id":"vOaDiG8SQLBg","createdAt":"2026-04-07T10:21:14.083Z","updatedAt":"2026-06-24T11:04:07.671Z","lang":"en","data":{"ads":{"remove_ads":"Remove ads","promoted_ad":"Promoted ad"},"api":{"mcp":{"cta":"Explore MCP Integration","title":"Agent-Ready via Model Context Protocol (MCP)","example":"An AI agent can search footage, generate supporting media, and return structured results in a single automated workflow.","discovery":{"title":"Content Discovery","description":"Programmatic content discovery across video, audio, and image libraries."},"execution":{"title":"Tool Execution","description":"Structured tool execution inside agent frameworks like LangChain and AutoGPT."},"retrieval":{"title":"Search & Retrieval","description":"Autonomous search and retrieval with structured, context-aware results."},"workflows":{"title":"Media Workflows","description":"Multi-step media workflows that chain search, generation, and delivery."},"description":"The Coverr API integrates with AI agents and automated systems using MCP compatibility."},"faqs":[{"answer":"Yes. You get 1,000 free API calls per month on the Staging tier. This is great for evaluation and development. Upgrade to Production for higher limits.","question":"Is the API free?"},{"answer":"Staging apps get 1,000 calls per month. Production apps get 500 calls per minute. Enterprise plans with custom limits are available on request.","question":"What are the rate limits?"},{"answer":"Absolutely. All content accessed through the API is commercially licensed. Videos require Coverr attribution — see our documentation for details.","question":"Can I use the API for commercial purposes?"},{"answer":"Once your Staging app is ready, request Production verification from your dashboard. After approval, you’ll get 500 requests per minute with no monthly cap.","question":"How do I scale to production?"},{"answer":"Yes. The Coverr API supports the Model Context Protocol (MCP), enabling AI agents to discover, search, and retrieve content autonomously within multi-step workflows.","question":"Is the API compatible with MCP / AI agents?"},{"answer":"Yes. Enterprise solutions with custom rate limits, SLAs, and dedicated support are available. \u003Ca href=\"mailto:team@coverr.co\" target=\"_blank\">Contact our team\u003C/a> to discuss your requirements.","question":"Do you offer enterprise support?"}],"meta":{"title":"Production-Ready Content API That Scales | Coverr","description":"Access curated stock video and AI-generated media through a single, high-performance API. Built for modern products. Agent-ready via MCP."},"scale":{"title":"Built to Handle Real Traffic","feature_1":{"title":"Simple Integration","description":"Deploy in minutes with straightforward REST endpoints."},"feature_2":{"title":"Reliability","description":"Serving hundreds of thousands of daily calls across Coverr products and partners."},"feature_3":{"title":"Scalability","description":"From early-stage startups to high-throughput SaaS platforms."}},"title":"Production-Ready Content API That Scales","powered":{"title":"Powered by Coverr","description":"See the Video API in action"},"pricing":{"cta":"View Pricing Plans","title":"Scale Beyond the Free Tier","limits":{"title":"Higher Limits","description":"Increase monthly API call limits for production workloads."},"premium":{"title":"Premium Access","description":"Access premium-only content and advanced API features."},"support":{"title":"Priority Support","description":"Dedicated support for scaling teams and enterprise needs."},"throughput":{"title":"Production Throughput","description":"Unlock higher request rates to handle real user traffic."},"coming_soon":"Generative Endpoints — Coming Soon","description":"Start free with 1,000 calls/month. Upgrade to unlock higher production quotas, priority access, and advanced capabilities.","coming_soon_description":"AI video, image, music, and SFX generation endpoints will be available under paid plans with usage-based quotas."},"signals":{"rest":"REST-based, simple integration","stock_ai":"Stock + AI in one API","free_calls":"1,000 free calls/month"},"examples":{"get":"Get a video","list":"Search videos","title":"Make Your First API Call in Minutes","search":"List popular videos"},"subtitle":"Access curated stock video and AI-generated media through a single, high-performance API. Built for modern products. Agent-ready via MCP.","final_cta":{"title":"Ready to Integrate Scalable Content Into Your Product?","contact_sales":"Contact Sales"},"use_cases":{"cases":[{"cta":"Start Building","title":"SaaS Platforms & Creator Tools","problem":"Content platforms need reliable, searchable media libraries without managing storage.","solution":"Embed the Coverr API to offer video, image, and audio search directly inside your product."},{"cta":"Start Building","title":"Marketing Automation & Ad-Tech","problem":"Marketing teams waste hours sourcing and licensing content for campaigns.","solution":"Automate content selection with semantic search and programmatic access to licensed media."},{"cta":"Start Building","title":"Enterprise Workflow Systems","problem":"Internal tools lack dynamic media for reports, dashboards, and communications.","solution":"Integrate stock and AI-generated content into enterprise workflows via REST API."},{"cta":"Start Building","title":"AI Application Builders","problem":"AI products need structured media access for multi-modal generation pipelines.","solution":"Use MCP-compatible endpoints for autonomous content discovery and retrieval."}],"title":"Built for Every Use Case"},"how_to_use":{"cta":"See Pricing","title":"From API Key to Production","step_1":{"title":"Get Your API Key","description":"Create an account and access your key instantly."},"step_2":{"title":"Make a Request","description":"Call any endpoint using REST."},"step_3":{"title":"Scale to Production","description":"Move from 1,000 monthly calls to unlimited calls and downloads (500 reqs/minute)."}},"get_api_key":"Get API Key","get_started":"Get Started","brands_title":"Trusted by Leading Platforms","capabilities":{"title":"One API. Multiple Content Capabilities","ai_music":{"items":["Generate original music tracks via API","Create sound effects for apps and video workflows","Automate audio creation inside production pipelines"],"title":"AI-Generated Content (Music & SFX)"},"ai_video":{"items":["Generate videos programmatically via API","Create AI images for dynamic visual experiences","Embed generation directly inside SaaS products"],"title":"AI-Generated Content (Video & Images)"},"ai_search":{"items":["Natural language search across video and audio","Context-aware results (scene, mood, intent)","Optimized for programmatic workflows"],"title":"Semantic AI Search"},"stock_music":{"items":["Access royalty-free tracks in high-quality formats","Filter by genre, mood, and instrumentation","Commercial-ready licensing"],"title":"Original Stock Music"},"stock_video":{"items":["Search and retrieve curated HD & 4K footage","Commercial-safe licensing for product use","Structured metadata for reliable filtering"],"title":"Original Stock Video"}},"documentation":"View Documentation"},"auth":{"password_reset":{"title":"Reset password","cancel":"Back to Login","errors":{"passwords_not_matched":"Passwords doesn’t match"},"submit":"Reset password","description":"Create a new password.","new_password":"New Password","repeat_password":"Confirm password","new_password_placeholder":"Create a new password","repeat_password_placeholder":"Let’s check again"},"forgot_password":"Forgot password?","verify_email_error":{"title":"Email verification link is no longer valid","submit":"Go to settings","description":""},"password_reset_error":{"title":"Password reset link is no longer valid","cancel":"Back to Login","submit":"Request password reset link","description":""},"continue_with_facebook":"Continue with Facebook","request_password_reset":{"title":"Reset password","cancel":"Back to Login","submit":"Request password reset link","description":"Don’t worry! A password reset link will be sent to the email provided.","email_placeholder":"Enter your e-mail"},"verify_email_confirmation":{"title":"Email verification successful!","submit":"Back to Home","description":""},"password_reset_confirmation":{"title":"Password reset successful!","submit":"Back to Login","description":""},"request_email_verification_success":"Email verification request has been sent","request_password_reset_confirmation":{"title":"Password reset link has been sent to your email","submit":"Back to Login","description":"Please check {{email}} for the password reset link."}},"blog":{"hero":{"title":"Blog","description":"Behind the scenes of the creation and utilization of stunning, free videos"},"meta":{"title":"Blog | Coverr","description":"Behind the scenes of the creation and utilization of stunning, free videos."}},"grid":{"title":"Stock Videos","load_more":"Load more","open_video":"Open Coverr video","title_free":"Free Stock Videos","title_more":"More Stock Videos","title_param":"{{ name }} Stock Videos","audios_title":"Free Stock Music","images_title":"Free Stock Images","title_related":"Related Free Stock Videos","title_more_free":"More Free Stock Videos","title_free_param":"Free {{ name }} Stock Videos","title_more_param":"More {{ name }} Stock Videos","audios_title_param":"Free {{ name }} Stock Music","images_title_param":"Free {{ name }} Stock Images","title_more_partners":"More from Our Partners","title_related_param":"Related {{ name }} Stock Videos","title_more_free_param":"More Free {{ name }} Stock Videos","title_related_free_param":"Related Free {{ name }} Stock Videos"},"home":{"faq":{"questions":[{"answer":"Yes! Coverr video is a completely free stock footage website that allows you to download and use high-quality stock videos anywhere. And there is no catch! No sign-up needed, no attribution required or hidden tricks anywhere, when we say free, we mean it.","question":"Are all Coverr videos completely free? What’s the catch?"},{"answer":"Of course you can, please do!","question":"Can Coverr Videos be used for commercial projects?"},{"answer":"Yes, we do! Check out our \u003Ca href=\"/developers\" aria-label=\"Developers page\" class=\"acu-link\">API documentation\u003C/a> for more details.","question":"Do you have an API?"}],"more_title":"Still have questions?","more_button":"See more questions about our free videos"},"meta":{"title":"Free Stock Video Footage, Royalty Free Videos for Download","description":"Download royalty free (for personal and commercial use), unique and beautiful video footage for your website or any project. No attribution required."},"plus":{"billed":{"yearly":"per month, billed yearly","monthly":"per month, billed monthly"},"titleHTML":"Get Exclusive Perks and Boost Your Creativity with \u003Cspan class=\"color-gradient-blue\">Coverr+ Premium Content\u003C/span>","description":"Upgrade to Coverr+ and enjoy members-only content, higher quality files and more..."},"music":{"text":"Never worry about rights and royalty","moods":{"title":"Mood","1_card_title":"Uplifting","2_card_title":"Dreamy","3_card_title":"Peaceful"},"genres":{"title":"Genres","1_card_title":"Hip Hop","2_card_title":"Cinematic","3_card_title":"Electronic"},"titleHTML":"Try \u003Cspan class=\"color-gradient-cyan\">Coverr music\u003C/span>","instruments":{"title":"Instruments","1_card_title":"Synth","2_card_title":"Piano","3_card_title":"Guitar"}},"title":"Beautiful Free Stock Video Footage","videos":{"cta":"Browse Video Library","title":"Explore Coverr’s Stock Video Library","description":"Discover high-quality HD & 4K footage — curated for creators like you","getty_title":"Popular iStock Videos"},"trending":"Trending","subscribe":{"text":"Join the Coverr community and get exclusive videos and special offers every week. Unlock our curated collection by entering your email below.","title":"Exclusive free videos weekly","text_subscribed":"Download our curated collection","explore_collection":"Explore collection"},"main_links":{"slide_1":{"title":"Free Stock Videos","description":"Access library of free stock videos"},"slide_2":{"title":"Royalty Free Music","description":"Explore our library of free stock music"},"slide_3":{"title":"AI Video Generator","description":"Generate stunning videos in seconds"},"slide_4":{"title":"AI Image Generator","description":"Create high-quality images from text"},"slide_5":{"title":"AI Music Generator","description":"Generate original music from text"},"slide_6":{"title":"AI Voiceover","description":"Create voiceovers for videos"},"slide_7":{"title":"AI Sound Effects","description":"Unique sound effects in seconds"}},"next_slide":"Next slide","prev_slide":"Previous slide","image_categories":{"title":"Image Categories"},"more_collections":"More collections","video_categories":{"title":"Video Categories","view_all":"View All"},"explore_collections":"Explore video collections","hero_download_video":"Download featured video"},"menu":{"company":"Company","community":"Community","developers_api":"Developers / API"},"plus":{"toggle":{"left":"Monthly","right_HTML":"Yearly \u003Cspan class=\"color-new-primary-main\">(save up to {{ save }}%)\u003C/span>","right_compact_HTML":"Yearly \u003Cspan class=\"color-new-primary-main\">(save {{ save }}%)\u003C/span>"},"compare":{"title":"Compare Plans","sections":{"stock_content":"Stock content","voice_and_sfx":"Voice & SFX","audio_generation":"Music Generation","image_generation":"Image Generation","video_generation":"Video Generation"},"subtitle":"Here’s a breakdown of how many credits are required for each type of AI feature","get_started":"Get Started with","toggle_label":"Pay yearly","credits_param":"{{ credits }} AI credits","limited_usage":"Limited usage","stock_content_titles":{"4k":"4K videos","wav_music":"WAV music","premium_content":"Premium content","attribution_required":"Attribution required"},"credits_per_month_param":"{{ credits }} AI credits/month"},"payment":{"cancel":{"title":"Cancel anytime","description":"No hidden stuff or hard feelings"},"secure":{"title":"Secure payment","description":"Transactions are encrypted and secured"},"methods":{"title":"Payment Methods"}},"one_hour":"1 hour","off_param":"{{ save }}% OFF","two_hours":"2 hours","two_minutes":"2 minutes","free_plan_features":["Selected AI video models","Selected AI image models","Free Videos & Music with sponsored ads","HD Video Quality & MP3 Music"],"paid_plan_features":[{"label":"Full AI Studio access","explanation":"Unlock every AI model in the studio — video, image, audio generation, and more."},{"tags":["New"],"label":"Coverr Recreate","explanation":"Transform your videos with AI — change weather, lighting, time of day, angles, and objects."},{"label":"4K Footage & WAV Music"},{"label":"Premium cinematic stock footage"},{"tags":["Veo 3.1","Sora 2"],"label":"All latest models"},{"label":"Google Nano Banana"},{"label":"{{ tasks }} parallel tasks","explanation":"Run up to {{ tasks }} AI generations at the same time."},{"label":"Ad‑Free Experience"},{"label":"Priority generations & support"}],"credits_amount_param":{"label":"{{ credits }} AI credits","voiceovers_param":"\u003Cspan class=\"color-new-primary-main\">~{{ count }}\u003C/span> voiceovers","audios_plural_param":"\u003Cspan class=\"color-new-primary-main\">~{{ count }}\u003C/span> audio tracks","images_plural_param":"\u003Cspan class=\"color-new-primary-main\">~{{ count }}\u003C/span> images","videos_plural_param":"\u003Cspan class=\"color-new-primary-main\">~{{ count }}\u003C/span> short videos","audios_singular_param":"\u003Cspan class=\"color-new-primary-main\">~{{ count }}\u003C/span> audio track","images_singular_param":"\u003Cspan class=\"color-new-primary-main\">~{{ count }}\u003C/span> image","videos_singular_param":"\u003Cspan class=\"color-new-primary-main\">~{{ count }}\u003C/span> short video"},"black_friday_tag_param":"Black Friday Sale up to {{ save }}% off"},"sstk":{"codeHTML":"Code: \u003Cspan class=\"code-accent\">{{code}}\u003C/span>","view_all":"View all","promoHTML":"\u003Cspan class=\"promo-accent\">Limited Time\u003C/span> - {{discount}}% off on Shutterstock Footage","open_video":"Open shutterstock video","title_popular":"Popular Shutterstock Videos","title_related":"Related Shutterstock Videos","title_related_v2":"Related videos","premium_beat_title":"Popular PremiumBeat Music","exclusive_content_HTML":"Get exclusive tracks on \u003Cspan class=\"color-gradient-cyan\">PremiumBeat\u003C/span>"},"about":{"free":{"title":"Yes, we said free","paragraph_1":"There’s no catch here. We grew our business by leveraging our talents as creators, but we know that not everyone has the skills or resources to do so. As filmmakers first, we believe that good video deserves to be paid for, so we pay creators to bring you exceptional videos from around the world.","paragraph_2":"But we share them free to empower entrepreneurs, dreamers, and builders to launch their next project a little easier. So make something really cool with our videos, OK?"},"hero":{"body":"Coverr was born out of our own business needs and grown from our passion as filmmakers.","title":"Videos for everyone"},"meta":{"title":"About Us | Coverr","description":"Coverr was born out of our own business needs and grown from our passion as filmmakers. While our videos are free, we’re paying the filmmakers behind them. | Coverr"},"story":{"title":"We consist of forward-looking videos, created to inspire, energize and support you.","paragraph_1":"Founded in 2015, Coverr offers a catalog of thousands of free, high-quality videos that have been downloaded more than 5 million times and are viewed 1.1 million times each month.","paragraph_2":"Coverr began as a Veed.me side project when we realized that we, along with so many entrepreneurs and startups, needed beautiful videos for the products we build. As filmmakers ourselves, we were already shooting footage in our spare time, so why not give it to the world, absolutely free?","paragraph_3":"As we continued to work on our businesses, Veed.me was acquired by Fiverr, but we continue to growing Coverr as our side project — true to its roots.","paragraph_4":"We’ve always been hyper-obsessed with making quality videos accessible to everyone. We started our journey in 2012 when we founded our video production marketplace, Veed.me. Veed.me was launched with the simple premise of connecting talented filmmakers and film students with great companies looking to create videos — no big, expensive agencies necessary."},"know_more":{"title":"Know more about us","read_article":"Read article","visit_our_medium":"Visit our Medium"}},"getty":{"promo":"Exclusive: -{{discount}}% off with code","open_getty":"Open Getty","promo_copied":"Promotion Code was copied to clipboard!","title_explore":"Explore iStock Videos","cta_remove_ads":"Remove ads","title_trending":"Trending on iStock","title_sponsored":"Sponsored by iStock","affiliate_end_promo":"Need more? Visit our partner and use promocode"},"music":{"freebies":{"title":"While you wait, here are some freebies","genres":{"pop":"Pop","ambient":"Ambient","cinematic":"Cinematic"}},"premium_beat":{"categories":{"pop":"Pop","jazz":"Jazz","cinematic":"Cinematic","corporate":"Corporate","electronic":"Electronic"}}},"terms":{"li_1":{"title":"Acceptance of Terms","section_1":"The following agreement consists of the terms and conditions governing use and access by contributors of videos to the Website (\u003Cstrong>\"Contributor(s)\"\u003C/strong>), and users who download Videos (defined below) from the Website (\u003Cstrong>\"User(s)\"\u003C/strong>; Contributors and Users are collectively defined as \u003Cstrong>\"you\"\u003C/strong> or \u003Cstrong>\"user\"\u003C/strong>). \u003Cstrong>“Website”\u003C/strong> shall mean Veedme Ltd.’s (\u003Cstrong>\"Coverr\"\u003C/strong> or \u003Cstrong>\"We\"\u003C/strong>) website available at: \u003Ca href=\"https://coverr.co/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://coverr.co/ \u003C/a>and the features, services and content therein. These COVERR TERMS OF USE together with the Coverr Privacy Policy available at: \u003Ca href=\"https://coverr.co/privacy/\" target=\"_blank\">https://coverr.co/privacy\u003C/a> (the \u003Cstrong>\"Terms\"\u003C/strong>) constitute a binding agreement between you and Coverr, and by continuing to use the Website (in whole or in part) in any way or manner you agree to abide by, and be bound, by these Terms. If you do not understand and/or agree to these Terms, you should immediately exit the Website and cease making any use thereof.","section_2":"We may unilaterally change or add to the terms of these Terms at any time. In the event of a material change, We shall notify you via email or by means of a prominent notice on the Website. You should check our Website periodically and review changes to the Terms at the following URL: \u003Ca href=\"https://coverr.co/terms/\" target=\"_blank\">https://coverr.co/terms/\u003C/a>. By continuing to use the Website following such modifications, you agree to be bound by such modifications. If you are not comfortable with all of the provisions of these Terms, please do not use the Website."},"li_2":{"title":"License","section_1":"Subject to the terms and conditions set forth herein, Coverr hereby grants to you, and you accept, a personal, nonexclusive, non-transferable, non-assignable, non-sublicensable, revocable, limited license to access and make  non-commercial use of the Website. The third party video content, moving images, animations, films, or other audio/visual representations provided on the Website (\u003Cstrong>“Videos”\u003C/strong>), are licensed directly by the authors of the Videos in accordance with the terms of the license set forth at \u003Ca href=\"https://coverr.co/license/\" target=\"_blank\">https://coverr.co/license\u003C/a>."},"li_3":{"title":"Limitations on Use ","section_1":"Except as specifically permitted herein, you agree not to (i) sell, license (or sub-license), lease, assign, transfer, pledge, or share any of your rights under these Terms with/to any third party; (ii) transfer, distribute, scrap, copy all or any part of the Website and/or the Coverr IPR (as defined below); (iii) refer to the Website by use of framing; (iv) make use of the Website in any jurisdiction where same are illegal or which would subject Coverr or its affiliates to any registration requirement within such jurisdiction or country; (v) use, or encourage, promote, facilitate or instruct others to use the Website for any illegal, harmful or offensive use; (vi) transmit or upload any viruses, spyware or other harmful, infringing, illegal, disruptive or destructive content, messages or files; (vii) access the Website through or use with the Website any unauthorized means, services or tools including without limitation any data mining, robots, or any other automated means or data gathering and extraction tools, including without limitation in order to extract for re-utilization of any parts of this Website; (viii) perform any act that destabilizes, interrupts or encumbers the Website or its servers or use automatic means,  robots or crawlers, that enable sending more request messages to the servers of the Website, in a given period of time, than a human can reasonably send in that time period by using the Website; (ix) copy, modify, translate, reverse engineer, decompile, disassemble (except to the extent applicable laws specifically prohibit such restriction), make any attempt to discover the source code of the Website and/or any other software available on the Website or create derivative works thereof; (x) penetrate or circumvent or attempt to penetrate or circumvent any technical restrictions or limitations included in the Website or its servers. You are solely responsible for obtaining, paying for, repairing and maintaining all the equipment, software, hardware and services required for getting access to and using the Website."},"li_4":{"title":"Ownership of Proprietary Rights","section_1":"The Website, including without limitation any underlying data, software, platforms, algorithms, technology, design, UI, any information, services, texts, files, charts, graphs, photos, videos, sound, music, organization, structure, \"look and feel\" and features and any modifications, enhancements and derivatives thereof and all Intellectual Property Rights related thereto (\u003Cstrong>\"Coverr IPR\"\u003C/strong>) are the exclusive property of Coverr and/or its licensors who retain all right, title and interest in connection therewith.","section_2":"No transfer or grant of any rights by Coverr is made or is to be implied by any provision of these Terms or by any other provision contained in the Website with respect to the Coverr IPR or otherwise, except for the limited license set forth in Section 2 above.","section_3":"\u003Cstrong>\"Intellectual Property Rights\"\u003C/strong> means worldwide, whether registered or not (a) rights associated with works of authorship, designs, mask works and photography including copyrights; (b) trademarks, service marks, domain names, logos, trade names, trade dress, the right to publicity and goodwill rights; (c) patents, patent applications and industrial designs; (d) trade secrets; (e) rights analogous to those set forth herein and any other proprietary rights relating to intangible property; (f) divisions, continuations, renewals, reissues and extensions of the foregoing (as applicable) now existing or hereafter filed, issued, or acquired."},"li_5":{"li_1":"\u003Cstrong>5.1. Contributor Content.\u003C/strong> Contributors shall have sole responsibility and liability for Contributor Content. Coverr shall not be liable for any and all parts of Contributor Content and shall be entitled, under its sole discretion, to remove or edit any of Contributor Content at Coverr’s sole discretion and without notice or explanation. Coverr does not provide back-up or archive services, Contributors are solely responsible for maintaining adequate backups of Contributor Content. Contributors hereby grant Coverr a worldwide, irrevocable, perpetual, royalty-free license to use and fully exploit Contributor Content, without restrictions, including without limitation to distribute and commercialize Contributor Content.","li_2":"\u003Cstrong>5.2. Representations and Warranties.\u003C/strong> Contributors hereby represent and warrant to Coverr that Contributor Content: (i) complies with and will comply with all applicable laws, rules and regulations, the Terms and will not infringe the rights of any third party, including without limitation any Intellectual Property Rights and the right to privacy, (ii) does not contain any threatening, offensive, racist, hateful, threatening, violent, sexually explicit, obscene, libelous, defamatory or otherwise inappropriate, (iii) does not contain any viruses, Trojan horses, worms or similar malware or any other harmful code, and (iv) is free from any restrictions, third party rights, payment obligations and/or royalties (including without limitation to any collecting societies).","title":"Contributor Content","section_1":"\u003Cstrong>\"Contributor Content\"\u003C/strong> shall mean any and all content that you upload, send or refer to through the Website or provide to Coverr, including without limitation any images, videos, sound, music, photos, animations or any other content or information."},"li_6":{"title":"User Warranties and Representations","section_1":"You represent and warrant to Coverr that you and your use of the Website and Videos will comply with all applicable laws, regulations, rules and standards. If you are a Conributor, you also represent and warrant to Coverr that you have, and will have at all times, all permits, consents, licenses and approvals as required to fulfill your obligations herein, including without limitation in respect of Contributor Content. "},"li_7":{"title":"Privacy","section_1":"Coverr’s privacy practices are governed by Coverr’s privacy policy, the most updated copy of which can be found at \u003Ca href=\"https://coverr.co/privacy/\" target=\"_blank\">https://coverr.co/privacy/\u003C/a> (\u003Cstrong>\"Privacy Policy\"\u003C/strong>)."},"li_8":{"title":"Disclaimer","section_1":"COVERR IS NOT A PARTY TO USER’S ENGAGEMENT WITH ANY CONTRIBUTIR OR TO USER’S USE OF ANY VIDEOS. THE LICENSE TO THE VIDEOS IS GRANTED DIRECTLY BY THE CONTRIBUTROS AND COVERR SERVES MERELY AS A PLATFORM. COVER DOES NOT SCREEN THE VIDEOS OR CHECK IF THEY INFRINGE ANY RIGHTS OR INCLUDE INAPPROPRIATE CONTENT.","section_2":"YOU AGREE THAT YOUR USE OF THE WEBSITE AND/OR THE COVERR IPR SHALL BE AT YOUR OWN RISK. THE WEBSITE, INCLUDING WITHOUT LIMITATION VEEDME IPR ARE PROVIDED \"AS IS\" AND WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND EITHER EXPRESS OR IMPLIED. TO THE FULLEST EXTENT PERMISSIBLE PURSUANT TO APPLICABLE LAW, COVERR DISCLAIMS ALL WARRANTIES, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING WITHOUT LIMITATION IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, NON-INFRINGEMENT AND FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE.","section_3":"COVERR DOES NOT WARRANT THAT THE COVERR IPR, THE VIDEOS AND/OR WEBSITE WILL BE UNINTERRUPTED OR ERROR-FREE, OR THAT THE WEBSITE, THE VIDEOS OR THE SERVER(S) THAT MAKES THEM AVAILABLE ARE FREE OF VIRUSES OR OTHER HARMFUL COMPONENTS","section_4":"COVERR DOES NOT WARRANT OR MAKE ANY REPRESENTATIONS REGARDING THE USE OR THE RESULTS OF THE USE OF THE COVERR IPR, THE VIDEOS OR WEBSITE INCLUDING WITHOUT LIMITATION THEIR CORRECTNESS, COMPLETENESS, ACCURACY, RELIABILITY, AVAILABILITY OR OTHERWISE. YOU ARE RESPONSIBLE FOR TAKING ALL PRECAUTIONS NECESSARY OR ADVISABLE TO PROTECT YOURSELF AGAINST ANY CLAIM, DAMAGE, LOSS OR HAZARD THAT MAY ARISE BY VIRTUE OF YOUR USE OF OR RELIANCE UPON THE WEBSITE, THE VIDEOS AND/OR ANY OF THE COVERR IPR.","section_5":"SOME JURISDICTIONS DO NOT ALLOW THE EXCLUSION OF CERTAIN IMPLIED WARRANTIES. ACCORDINGLY, SOME OF THE ABOVE LIMITATIONS MAY NOT APPLY TO YOU."},"li_9":{"title":"Limitation of Liability","section_1":"TO THE MAXIMUM PERMITTED UNDER LAW, UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCES WHATSOEVER WILL COVERR AND ITS AFFILIATES AND ITS AND THEIR PARTNERS, OFFICERS, DIRECTORS, EMPLOYEES, SHAREHOLDERS, AGENTS, LICENSORS, SUBCONTRACTS AND SUPPLIERS BE RESPONSIBLE OR LIABLE TO YOU OR TO ANY OTHER ENTITY, EVEN IF ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGES, UNDER ANY LEGAL THEORY, WHETHER CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE FOR ANY DIRECT, COMPENSATORY, INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, CONSEQUENTIAL INCLUDING WITHOUT LIMITATION ANY LOST PROFITS AND LOST BUSINESS OPPORTUNITIES, BUSINESS INTERUPTION, REVENUE, INCOME, GOODWILL, USE, DATA OR OTHER TANGIBLE OR INTANGIBLE LOSSES, SPECIAL, EXEMPLARY, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES THAT RESULT FROM OR RELATE IN ANY MANNER WHATSOEVER TO YOUR USE OF THE WEBSITE, THE VIDEOS OR COVERR IPR, OR RELIANCE THEREON OR TO ANY ERRORS, INACCURACIES, OMISSIONS, DEFECTS, SECURITY BREACHES, OR ANY OTHER FAILURE TO PERFORM BY COVERR.","section_2":"SOME JURISDICTIONS DO NOT ALLOW THE LIMITATION OR EXCLUSION OF LIABILITY FOR INCIDENTAL OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES. ACCORDINGLY, SOME OF THE ABOVE LIMITATIONS MAY NOT APPLY TO YOU."},"meta":{"title":"Free Stock Video Footage Terms of Use | Coverr","description":"All Videos published on Coverr.co can be used free for commercial and non-commercial purposes. You do not need to ask permission from or provide credit to the videographer or Coverr.co, although it is appreciated when possible."},"li_10":{"title":"Indemnification","section_1":"You agree to defend, indemnify and hold Coverr and anyone on its behalf, including but not limited to, all of its owners, managers, officers, affiliates, employees, licensors and suppliers harmless against any losses, expenses, costs, claims, damages (including attorneys’ fees, expert fees’ and other costs of litigation) arising from, incurred as a result of, or in any manner related to: (i) your use of the Website; (ii) any breach of these Terms."},"li_11":{"title":"Third Party Content","section_1":"The Website contains content provided by third parties and links to outside services and resources. Coverr does not screen, monitor or control such content and services. Any concerns regarding any such linked service or resource should be directed to such particular service or resource provider. Coverr is not responsible or liable for such links and/or content. Without derogating from the foregoing, should you leave the Website via a link contained herein and/or view content that is not provided by Coverr, you do so at your own risk and Coverr shall not be responsible or liable for damages or losses caused in connection therewith. In as much as you are redirected to linked sites, applications and content, We recommend you to carefully read and abide by the terms of use and privacy policies of such applications, sites and content. "},"li_12":{"title":"Notice and Takedown","section_1":"If you believe that any Videos or other content on the Website infringe any of your Intellectual Property Rights or the privacy of any person, please notify Coverr at \u003Ci>\u003Ca href=\"mailto:team@coverr.co\" target=\"_blank\">team@coverr.co\u003C/a>\u003C/i> with information that is sufficient for identification of said content and to verify the allegation and Coverr shall review your request. "},"li_13":{"title":"Termination","section_1":"We may terminate these Terms and/or suspend your right to access or use any portion or all of the Website and/or Coverr IPR immediately (including without limitations the license set forth in Section 2 above), at our sole discretion without notice. Upon termination you shall immediately cease using the Website and the following Sections shall survive: 1, 3-14."},"li_14":{"title":"General","section_1":"(i) These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Israel, without regard to the principles of conflict of law therein. The parties consent to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Tel Aviv-Jaffa, Israel. The application of the United Nations Convention of Contracts for the International Sale of Goods or other international laws is expressly excluded; (ii) notwithstanding the foregoing, in the event of breach or threatened breach by of any provision of these Terms by you, Coverr could suffer significant and irreparable harm that could not be satisfactorily compensated in monetary terms, and that the remedies at law available to Coverr may otherwise be inadequate and Coverr shall be entitled, in addition to any other remedies to which it may be entitled to under law or in equity, to the immediate ex parte issuance, without bond, of an equitable relief, including without limitation an injunctive relief, in any jurisdiction worldwide. You hereby acknowledge and agree that Coverr shall not be required to post bond as a condition to obtaining or exercising any such remedies, and you hereby waive any such requirement or condition; (iii) if any provision of these Terms is held to be unenforceable, such provision shall be reformed only to the extent necessary to make it enforceable and if such provision is determined to be invalid or unenforceable nonetheless, the provision shall be deemed to be severable from the remainder of these Terms and shall not cause the invalidity or unenforceability of the remainder of these Terms; (iv) You acknowledge and agree that Coverr has the right, at any time and for any reason, to redesign or modify the Coverr IPR and other elements of the Website or any part thereof; (v) these Terms are the entire agreement between you and Coverr regarding the subject matter herein and these Terms shall not be modified except by a written instrument executed by both parties; (vi)  Coverr may assign these Terms, in whole or in part, in its sole discretion. You are not entitled to assign or otherwise transfer the Terms, or any of your rights or obligations hereunder, to any third party without the prior written consent of Coverr. Any unauthorized assignment will be void and of no force or effect; (vii)  no provisions of these Terms are intended or shall be construed to confer upon or give to any person or entity other than you and Coverr any rights, remedies or other benefits under or by reason of these Terms; (viii) Coverr’s failure to enforce any rights granted hereunder or to take action against you in the event of any breach hereunder shall not be deemed a waiver by Coverr as to subsequent enforcement of rights or subsequent actions in the event of future breaches; (ix) all waivers must be in writing. Any waiver or failure to enforce any provision of these Terms on one occasion will not be deemed a waiver of any other provision or of such provision on any other occasion; (x) ANY CAUSE OF ACTION INITIATED BY YOU AND ARISING OUT OF OR RELATED TO THE WEBSITE, COVERR IPR AND/OR THE VIDEOS MUST COMMENCE WITHIN ONE (1) YEAR AFTER THE CAUSE OF ACTION ACCRUES. OTHERWISE, SUCH CAUSE OF ACTION IS PERMANENTLY BARRED AND YOU SHALL BE DEEMED TO WAIVE ANY CLAIM YOU MAY HAVE IN ESPECT THEREOF."},"li_15":{"title":"Coverr Plus","section_1":"\u003Cstrong>15.1 Subscription Terms:\u003C/strong> By subscribing to Coverr Plus, you agree to pay the applicable subscription fee and abide by the terms and conditions set forth in this Agreement. The subscription fee will be billed in advance on a monthly or annual basis, depending on the subscription plan you choose.","section_2":"\u003Cstrong>15.2 License Terms:\u003C/strong> Coverr Plus provides you with the same non-exclusive, non-transferable, worldwide license to use, reproduce, and display the videos and other content available through the service as the regular Coverr service. The subscription does not provide any different or additional license terms.","section_3":"\u003Cstrong>15.3 Access to Features and Content:\u003C/strong> Your subscription to Coverr Plus provides you with access to a set of features and content that may change from time to time, at Coverr’s discretion. Coverr may add, remove, or modify features and content available through Coverr Plus without notice.","section_4":"\u003Cstrong>15.4 Copyright Ownership:\u003C/strong> All content made available through Coverr Plus is owned by Coverr Platform Ltd. or its licensors and is protected by copyright laws. You acknowledge that you do not acquire any ownership rights in the content by using the service.","section_5":"\u003Cstrong>15.5 Renewal, Fees, and Taxes:\u003C/strong> Your Coverr Plus subscription will automatically renew at the end of each billing period, unless you cancel your subscription before the renewal date. You authorize Coverr to charge your payment method for the subscription fee and any applicable taxes. Coverr Plus subscription fees are exclusive of any sales tax, use tax, goods and services tax, harmonized sales tax, provincial sales tax, value-added tax, or any other services taxes or levies (\"\u003Cstrong>Transaction Taxes\u003C/strong>\"). You agree to pay and be responsible for all transaction Taxes imposed by any jurisdiction as a result of the services provided. Coverr reserves the right to change subscription plans or adjust pricing for services (all or part) in any manner and at any time, at its sole and absolute discretion. Coverr will give you written notice about any price changes or changes to your Coverr Plus subscription.","section_6":"\u003Cstrong>15.6 Termination:\u003C/strong> You may cancel your Coverr Plus subscription through the product settings or by emailing us at \u003Ca href=\"mailto:team@coverr.co\" target=\"_blank\">team@coverr.co.\u003C/a> The cancellation will become effective at the end of the current billing period. Coverr reserves the right to terminate your subscription at any time, without notice, for any reason or no reason, including if you violate any of these terms.","section_7":"\u003Cstrong>15.7 Disclaimer of Warranties:\u003C/strong> COVERR PLUS IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\" WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EITHER EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING WITHOUT LIMITATION ANY WARRANTY FOR INFORMATION, SERVICES, OR UNINTERRUPTED ACCESS. COVERR DOES NOT WARRANT OR MAKE ANY REPRESENTATIONS REGARDING THE USE OR THE RESULTS OF THE USE OF THE SERVICE IN TERMS OF ITS CORRECTNESS, ACCURACY, RELIABILITY, OR OTHERWISE.","section_8":"\u003Cstrong>15.8 Limitation of Liability:\u003C/strong> IN NO EVENT SHALL COVERR, ITS OFFICERS, DIRECTORS, EMPLOYEES, OR AGENTS BE LIABLE FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES ARISING OUT OF OR IN ANY WAY CONNECTED WITH THE USE OF THE SERVICE, WHETHER BASED ON CONTRACT, TORT, STRICT LIABILITY, OR ANY OTHER THEORY, EVEN IF COVERR HAS BEEN ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGES."},"title":"Coverr’s Terms of Use","section_1":"IMPORTANT: BY ACCESSING AND/OR USING THE WEBSITE (DEFINED BELOW) YOU ACCEPT THE FOLLOWING TERMS AND CONDITIONS. IF YOU DO NOT AGREE TO THE TERMS AND CONDITIONS SET FORTH HEREIN PLEASE DO NOT ACCESS OR USE THE WEBSITE.","section_2":"If you have any further questions or require further clarification, please contact us by sending an e-mail to: \u003Ci>\u003Ca href=\"mailto:team@coverr.co\" target=\"_blank\">team@coverr.co\u003C/a>\u003C/i> ","section_3":"\u003Ci>Last updated: Apr. 4th, 2023\u003C/i>"},"footer":{"legal":"Legal","company":"Company","explore":"Explore","copyright":"Copyright © {{ value }}. All rights reserved.","get_bonus":"Get bonus videos and other surprises","join_team":"Join our team","text_to_video":"Text to Video AI Workflows","image_to_video":"Image to Video AI Workflows","video_to_video":"Video to Video AI Workflows","for_contributors":"For contributors","free_stock_music":"Free Stock Music","free_stock_videos":"Free Stock Videos"},"header":{"zoom_link":"Zoom Virtual Backgrounds","free_images_link":"15% Off Premium Images"},"search":{"meta":{"title":"Download {{ total }} Free {{ query }} Stock Videos | Coverr","description":"Beautiful {{ query }} stock video footage for use on your website or any project (personal or commercial). Find high quality royalty free {{ query }} videos on Coverr"},"no_results":{"title":"No Matches Found. Let’s create one?","old_title":"Sorry, no matches found.","description_with_affiliate":"Try our new AI video generator, or explore iStock options below.","description_without_affiliate":"Try our new AI video generator."},"no_results_affiliate_grid":{"cta":"Generate in AI Studio","title":"No results for \u003Cspan class=\"color-text-new-primary\">\"{{ query }}\"\u003C/span>","description":"We couldn’t find any videos matching that search. Below are videos from our partners — download them, or create exactly what you need in \u003Ca href=\"/studio?ctx=search_noresults\" class=\"acu-link color-text-new-primary\">AI Studio\u003C/a>"}},"shared":{"ai":"AI","no":"No","ok":"OK","on":"On","all":"All","api":"API","app":"App","bad":"Bad","buy":"Buy","faq":"FAQ","new":"New","off":"off","sfx":"SFX","tvc":"TVC","ugc":"UGC","usd":"USD","yes":"Yes","alts":{"avatar":"Avatar","camera":"Camera image","user_hero":"User’s hero image","about_hero":"About page hero image","grid_image":"Grid image","coverr_logo":"Coverr main logo","user_avatar":"User avatar","car_in_desert":"Car in the desert","feature_image":"Image showing the feature in action","card_thumbnail":"Card thumbnail","creator_avatar":"Creator avatar","parallax_image":"Parallax image","contribute_hero":"Contribute page hero image","ma