 and we will place it on our homepage, first row below our collections."},"newsletter":{"title":"Newsletter","section":{"title":"Access unlimited free video content","description":"We are so exicted to have you onboard! Our mission is to provide free video content to all of our subscribers. Here is what you can do to always have the latest video content for all ocassions."},"description":"Our newsletter is a direct path to your audience on Coverr. With tens of thousands of eyeballs receiving it monthly and high open rate, this is the best way to measure direct engagement"},"description":"Bring your business to the masses with branded videos that will be shared by millions."},"ai_portal":{"sfx":{"empty":{"title":"Generate your first sound effect","description":"Your AI-generated sound effects will appear here once they’re ready"},"title":"SFX generator","toasts":{"duration_long_title":"Duration is too long","text_required_title":"Text is required","duration_short_title":"Duration is too short","text_required_subtitle":"Please enter a text to generate.","duration_required_title":"Duration is required","created_successfully_title":"Sound effect created successfully","duration_required_subtitle":"Please enter a duration to generate.","duration_long_subtitle_param":"Your duration is too long. Please keep it under {{ maxSeconds }} seconds.","duration_short_subtitle_param":"Your duration is too short. It must be at least {{ minSeconds }} seconds."},"text_label":"Describe the sound you need","description":"Instantly create realistic sound effects with AI. Perfect for videos, games, and podcasts.","duration_label":"Audio duration","examples_label":"Use examples to get started:","text_placeholder":"Rain with thunder...","credit_rate_param":"1 second costs {{ credits }} credits","duration_hint_param":"Generation duration between {{ min }} and {{ max }} seconds","credit_rate_param_default":"1 generation costs {{ credits }} credits"},"apps":{"title":"AI Apps","description":"Use 