"Your AI-generated images will appear here once they’re ready"},"title":"AI Image Generator","toasts":{"prompt_long_title":"Prompt is too long","prompt_short_title":"Prompt is too short","image_required_title":"Image is required","prompt_required_title":"Prompt is required","image_required_subtitle":"Please upload an image to generate.","prompt_required_subtitle":"Please enter a prompt to generate.","created_successfully_title":"Images created successfully","prompt_long_subtitle_param":"Your prompt is too long. Please keep it under {{ maxLength }} characters.","prompt_short_subtitle_param":"Your prompt is too short. It must be at least {{ minLength }} characters long."},"enhancer":{"title":"AI prompt enhancer","subtitle":"AI will refine your prompt for better results"},"description":"Generate images instantly with AI","credit_rate_param":"1 image costs {{ credits }} credits","prompt_placeholder":"Describe image here","ai_models_description":{"imagen_3":"Google’s highest quality text-to-image model","imagen_4":"Google’s next-generation text-to-image model with even higher visual fidelity","imagen_3_fast":"A faster and cheaper Imagen 3 model","imagen_4_fast":"A faster, cost-effective version of Imagen 4 for quick high-quality results"},"sample_count_label_param":"{{ count }} image","samples_count_label_param":"{{ count }} images"},"shared":{"tips":["All prompts should be direct and easily understood, not conceptual","Prompts should be descriptive, not conversational or command-based","Prompts should use positive phrasing"],"how_it_works":"How it works","minute_param":"{{ count }} minute","second_param":"{{ count }} second","view_pricing":"View pricing","minutes_param":"{{ count }} minutes","seconds_param":"{{ count }} seconds","enhance_prompt":"Enhance prompt","my_generations":"My generations","rate_limit_title":"Parallel generation limit reached","credits_available":"Credits available: {{ count }}","toast_description":"You can always buy more","used_free_credits":"You’ve used all your free credits. Upgrade to keep creating.","from_credits_param":"{{ count }}+ credits","signup_description":"Sign up to generate for free","generations_available":"Generations available: {{ count }}","all_models_description":"Pick any from {{ count }} available","free_generations_param":"{{ model }} free generations: {{ count }} left","rate_limit_description":"You’ve reached your parallel generation limit. Wait for current generations to finish or upgrade to continue without waiting","support_only_one_option":"This model supports only a single option"},"videos":{"title":"AI Video Generator","styles":"Styles","effects":"Effects","description":"Use the Image to Video or Text to Video AI generator","inspiration":"Inspiration","explore_more":"Explore more","recreate_tour":{"done_cta":"Let’s recreate!","textarea":{"title":"Add your details","description":"Describe how you’d like to reimagine your video — lighting, camera movement, or visual style. Then hit Generate to bring it to life."},"media_uploader":{"title":"Select a Video","description":"Choose a video from our stock library that you’d like to reimagine."},"app_prefference":{"title":"Select an App","description":"Choose what you want to do — for example New camera angles or Generate next shot."},"preset_prefference":{"title":"Select a Preset","description":"Pick a visual style to define your recreated video."},"mode_segment_controls":{"title":"Recreate is here","description":"Transform your existing videos — change camera angles, style, or even generate the next shot to continue your story."}},"generation_rate":"Generation cost: {{ cost }} credits","how_it_works_page":{"steps":{"generate":{"title":"Generate Video","description":"Click generate and watch AI create your video in minutes"},"configure":{"title":"Configure Settings","description":"Adjust duration, aspect ratio, resolution, and other parameters to customize your video"},"edit_video":{"title":"Upload Video to Edit","description":"Upload your video and let AI transform it with the selected style"},"upload_image":{"title":"Upload Image","description":"Upload an image as the starting frame for your animation"},"motion_control":{"title":"Add Character and Motion","description":"Upload a character image and a motion reference video to guide the AI"},"reference_video":{"title":"Provide Reference Video","description":"Upload a reference video to guide the motion and style of your result"},"start_end_frames":{"title":"Set Start & End Frames","description":"Upload the first and last frames to define your video’s transformation"},"references_images":{"title":"Add Reference Images","description":"Provide reference images to guide the video style and composition"}},"title":"Create AI Videos in Simple Steps","description":"Follow these steps to bring your ideas to life with our AI video generator."},"prompt_preferences":{"generate_audio":{"title":"Generate audio","description":"Veo 3 lets you add sound effects, ambient noise, and even dialogue to your creations"},"publish_consent":{"title":"Public Visibility","video_description":"When enabled, your video may be reviewed and featured by our editorial team on Coverr","images_description":"When enabled, your images may be reviewed and featured by our editorial team on Coverr"}},"signup_description":"Sign up to generate videos for free","ai_models_description":{"veo2":"Ultra-realistic and high-quality videos","veo3":"The most advanced AI video generation model in the world. With sound on!","ray_2":"Enhanced quality and motion consistency","kling_2":"Next-gen realism with dynamic scene understanding","ray_1_6":"Smooth cinematic video generation","gen4Turbo":"Fast, controllable and flexible video generation","kling_1_6":"Creative and expressive video synthesis","kling_2_1":"Unparalleled motion fluidity, cinematic visuals, and exceptional prompt precision","veo3_fast":"Speed meets creativity — create high-quality videos with sound in record time.","gen3aTurbo":"Fast and versatile AI video creation","seedance_1":"High-quality videos with cinematic motion, storytelling, and pro-grade effects"},"auto_model_description":"We’ll pick the best model for your prompt"},"ai_voices":{"empty":{"title":"No voices match your filters","description":"Try adjusting or resetting your filters"}},"voiceover":{"empty":{"title":"Generate your first voiceover","description":"Your AI-generated voiceovers will appear here once they’re ready"},"title":"Voiceover generator","toasts":{"prompt_long_title":"Prompt is too long","prompt_short_title":"Prompt is too short","voice_required_title":"Voice is required","prompt_required_title":"Prompt is required","voice_required_subtitle":"Please select a voice to generate.","prompt_required_subtitle":"Please enter a prompt to generate.","created_successfully_title":"Voiceover created successfully","prompt_long_subtitle_param":"Your prompt is too long. Please keep it under {{ count }} characters.","prompt_short_subtitle_param":"Your prompt is too short. It must be at least {{ count }} characters long."},"play_error":"Please select a voice first","text_label":"Add text here","credit_rate":"1 character costs 1 credit","description":"An AI Voiceover tool creates natural-sounding voiceovers, perfect for videos, presentations, and stories","explore_voices":"Explore voices","voice_placeholder":"Select a voice..."},"prompt_editor":{"cta_hint":"Your settings are ready — hit Generate"},"free_credits_toast":{"title":"Sign Up to get 1,000 free credits"},"override_expiring_soon":{"title":"Your unlimited access is expiring soon","description":"The discounted rate for this model expires in {{ days }} day(s)."},"need_verification_toast":{"title":"Verify your email to get started","description_param":"We sent a confirmation email to {{ email }}. Open the email and follow the steps to confirm"}},"not_found":{"meta":{"title":"404 | Coverr","description":"Page not found | Coverr"},"title":"Page not found","return":"Return to home","sub_title":"Try another way"},"plus_card":{"sign_up":"Sign Up for Free","best_value":"Best Value","most_popular":"Most Popular","cancel_anytime":"Cancel anytime — no hidden fees","free_trial_toast":"The free trial provides the capability to generate two (2) Google Veo videos and ten (10) AI images."},"plus_page":{"videos":{"title":"Featured premium videos"},"subscribe":{"save":"Save ${{ count }}","titleHTML":"Premium videos, \u003Cspan class=\"color-new-primary-main\">unlimited access,\u003C/span> and more.","billed_yearly":"per month,\nbilled yearly","billed_monthly":"per month,\nbilled monthly"},"collections":{"enjoyHTML":"Enjoy our \u003Cspan class=\"color-new-primary-main\">members-only content,\u003C/span> curated just for you","section_title":"Curated collections"},"trusted_creators":{"text":"Trusted by 1,000+ creators building with AI every day","text_compact":"Trusted by 1,000+ creators"}},"tool_page":{"hero":{"suggestions":[{"label":"Sunny Beach","prompt":"A peaceful sunny beach with waves gently crashing on the shore."},{"label":"City Night","prompt":"A busy city street at night with neon signs and passing cars."},{"label":"Mountain Hike","prompt":"A person hiking through a forest trail with mountains in the background."},{"label":"Rainy Window","prompt":"Raindrops falling on a window with a blurry view of the city outside."},{"label":"Desert Sunset","prompt":"A sunset over sand dunes with warm orange and pink colors."},{"label":"Forest Fog","prompt":"A dense forest covered in morning fog with light filtering through trees."}],"view_website":"View Website","submit_prompt":"Submit {{ toolName }} prompt","generate_in_studio":"Generate in Studio"},"explore":{"title":"Explore More AI Video Models"},"videos_grid":{"title_param":"Explore {{ toolName }} videos"}},"contact_us":{"form":{"name":"Your name","email":"Email address","error":"Something went wrong. Please try again","submit":"Send message","message":"Message","subject":"Subject","error_email":"Please enter a valid email address","success_desc":"We’ll get back to you as soon as possible","success_title":"Message sent!","error_required":"This field is required"},"link":"Contact Us","meta":{"title":"Contact Us | Coverr — Support for Creators","description":"Reach out to the Coverr team for support, licensing inquiries, or feedback. We’re here to help you find the perfect cinematic footage"},"title":"Get in Touch","overlay":{"title":"Create with us","description":"Join a community of world-class creators"},"description":"Have a question or feedback? We’d love to hear from you"},"contribute":{"meta":{"title":"Contribute Free Stock Footage And Get Paid | Coverr","description":"The only free stock footage website that pays to its contributors | Coverr"},"title":"Contribute free videos/music, get paid.","apply_now":"Apply now","section_1":{"title":"We support our community","description":"While we give all our videos away for free, we believe in paying the talented creators behind them. Coverr videos are carefully curated and creators are paid for their submissions. The more we grow, the more contributors we’re able to support."},"section_2":{"title":"We have a wide reach","description":"Coverr videos are seen and shared by hundreds of thousands of users. You can see your work cropping up everywhere from inspirational music videos to the next best app."},"section_3":{"title":"We believe in accessibility","description":"We started Coverr as a way to give access to those who can’t afford to commission or buy video footage. You’ll be empowering countless startups, dreamers, and believers on their missions to make something."},"description":"Share your talent with the Coverr community, get paid for your work, and watch millions of users showcase your videos across the globe.","apply_section":{"apply":"Apply to Contribute","title":"Did we mention you’ll get paid?","description":"Just want to make sure you saw that."},"sections_title":"Why contribute to Coverr?"},"intentions":[{"label":"To create organic online content","value":"To create organic online content"},{"label":"For commercial projects (online or TV ads.)","value":"For commercial projects (online or TV ads.)"},{"label":"For educational purposes","value":"For educational purposes"},{"label":"As a background video for my site","value":"As a background video for my site"},{"label":"Use it in my design as a placeholder","value":"Use it in my design as a placeholder"},{"label":"Education - I’m a teacher","value":"Education - I’m a teacher"},{"label":"Education - I’m a student","value":"Education - I’m a student"},{"label":"Zoom backgrounds","value":"Zoom backgrounds"},{"label":"Just for fun","value":"Just for fun"}],"smart_crop":{"info":"Smart crop explanation","title":"Choose Your Aspect Ratio","description":"Smart crop works best with custom ratios. Select anything other than ’Original’ or ’16:9’ to continue.’","explanation":"\u003Cb>Smart Crop:\u003C/b> Automatically optimize your video’s framing for any aspect ratio after selection. Ideal for videos with horizontal movement, this feature dynamically adjusts the crop to keep the main action in view, ensuring your subject remains the focal point across different formats. Please select your desired aspect ratio before activating Smart Crop for best results","toggle_explanation":"Select the aspect ratio and then our AI-powered smart crop feature will track objects in the video and automatically adjust the framing."},"validation":{"max_width":"Maximum width is {{ width }}","min_width":"Minimum width is {{ width }}","max_height":"Maximum height is {{ height }}","min_height":"Minimum height is {{ height }}","email_taken":"Email is already taken","max_size_mb":"Maximum size is {{ size }} MB","allowed_extensions":"Allowed extensions: {{ extensions }}","aspect_ratio_range":"Aspect ratio should be between {{ min }} and {{ max }}","failed_to_load_image":"Failed to load image","failed_to_load_video":"Failed to load video","image_size_too_large"