rr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-BLei1gN9HMqE/1080p.mp4"},{"id":"SpXgHx8yarYF","createdAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:24.910Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:24.910Z","name":"Eternal fog","prompt":"Reimagine the scene enveloped in soft, cinematic fog — mist rolling gently through the landscape while preserving clear visibility of the main subject and key details. The atmosphere should feel mysterious yet balanced, with diffused light, cool desaturated tones, and subtle depth. Inspired by “Silent Hill” and “The Others”, evoke a haunting stillness without obscuring composition or focal clarity.","appId":"GhSs2Gdwtucd","order":1,"key":"eternal-fog","imagePreviewUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/-1pRtm9","videoPreviewUrl":"https://cdn-staging.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-ekUaCHF2oPNb/1080p.mp4"},{"id":"DWrqzkuXMnIK","createdAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:24.910Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:24.910Z","name":"Neo noir rain","prompt":"Convert the environment into a rainy, reflective world — heavy rainfall, wet surfaces, neon and car light reflections creating a moody urban atmosphere. Inspired by “Blade Runner 2049”, emphasize cinematic lighting, contrast, and motion through glistening surfaces. Preserve original subject and framing while enhancing depth and emotional weight.","appId":"GhSs2Gdwtucd","order":2,"key":"neo-noir-rain","imagePreviewUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/-gMTGp7","videoPreviewUrl":"https://cdn-staging.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-IpPrlDDn1eBW/1080p.mp4"},{"id":"guE6ai8giMLZ","createdAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:24.910Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:24.910Z","name":"Frozen silence","prompt":"Transform the scene into a snow-covered, frozen landscape. Add drifting snowflakes, pale blue light, and muted desaturated tones that evoke cold isolation. Inspired by “The Revenant”, it should feel tactile and immersive, with visible breath and gentle wind movement. Maintain natural motion, focusing on atmosphere and texture.","appId":"GhSs2Gdwtucd","order":3,"key":"frozen-silence","imagePreviewUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/-AwjTL0","videoPreviewUrl":"https://cdn-staging.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-LmomlO5BKGM3/1080p.mp4"},{"id":"p26GQFJgUcZv","createdAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:24.910Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:24.910Z","name":"Apocalyptic dust","prompt":"Turn the setting into a chaotic sandstorm or post-collapse wasteland — swirling dust clouds, reduced visibility, and an orange-brown dystopian palette. Inspired by “Dune” and “Interstellar”, emphasize motion in the air, grainy light diffusion, and tension in the atmosphere. Preserve subject motion while immersing them in the storm’s intensity.","appId":"GhSs2Gdwtucd","order":4,"key":"apocalyptic-dust","imagePreviewUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/-khRQUW","videoPreviewUrl":"https://cdn-staging.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-UIvjmPIQn6Wa/1080p.mp4"},{"id":"WOxfpj7bmFjB","createdAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:24.910Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:24.910Z","name":"Electric storm","prompt":"Transform the world into a high-drama thunderstorm — dark rolling clouds, flashes of lightning illuminating the scene, and a palpable sense of tension. Inspired by “Inception” dream-collapse sequences, combine dynamic lighting, wet reflections, and cinematic pacing. Maintain realism and keep subject motion intact amid the electrified chaos.","appId":"GhSs2Gdwtucd","order":5,"key":"electric-storm","imagePreviewUrl":"https://cdn.coverr.co/images/-lqOVBD","videoPreviewUrl":"https://cdn-staging.coverr.co/videos/user-ai-generation-dydjDQAVFe2y/1080p.mp4"}]},{"id":"gNz9RQRWY1It","createdAt":"2025-10-28T15:26:47.839Z","updatedAt":"2025-11-29T00:19:39.449Z","name":"Change time of day","title":"Change time of day","description":"Seamlessly switch scenes from sunrise to sunset or day to night, with realistic lighting, shadows, and skies.","icon":"sunHorizonLine","type":"recreate","videoDetailsFeatured":true,"order":5,"key":"change-time-of-day","promptTemplate":"Change Time of Day","videoId":"jGmc